{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_04_beg","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_04","title":"重逢不乏意外","storyCode":"EP-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b4e7783b771e842716737cf64e6fbf204243c44b615cc23af3c1defdb5131aef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拘谨的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"驮兽入栏的时候，我不小心激怒了它，导致一名教士被抓伤，给我少盛些吧，就当是赎罪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多吃些，下次才不会出这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这条盐鳞够所有人饱餐一顿，大家都多吃些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拘谨的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，西尔弗大人，吃太饱的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总比浪费好。现在这个天气，盐鳞肉存不了太久，尽早吃完吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厨师先生，这几份麻烦你给受伤的教士们送去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些日子他们身上新伤叠旧伤的，也该好好补补了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执裁官阁下，那份计划书您看了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，您为何会有这样的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要那些强盗交出罗盘和盐船的设计图，我会赦免大多数人，允许他们以我指定的方式生活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们中有不少精壮的年轻人，如果我们的镇子要移动起来，那就是最宝贵的劳力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，掌握着这些不受教条束缚的刀剑，我们以后和谁谈判，都会轻松很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会毁了您的镇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除掉领头的那个阿戈尔人，剩下的强盗不过是一盘散沙。现在地下室铐着的那三个人，各自都打着自己的算盘呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到我把他们分裂开来，分别放在互相之间会有利益冲突的位置上......他们哪怕还有歹心，也只会向曾经的同伴举刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾经拯救了镇上的所有人，教他们克制欲望、保持纯洁......而如今您竟要为利益而赦免杀害过他们亲朋好友的强盗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕您能接受，您真的认为镇民们都能接受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这难道不是背叛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您认为该怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快会再带人深入盐漠，彻底剿灭残存的强盗，毁去他们用于作孽的一切手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看到受伤的教士们了。他们需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的人手和资源都不够再进行一次大规模围剿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会确保他们能够出战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，恕我直言，这不是您能做的决策，执裁官阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天色一暗下来，地下室的那三个强盗就会“偷溜”出镇。不出意外的话，他们很快就能把消息带回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您只需要在强盗上门谈判的时候维持秩序。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么突然改主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是修复一枚罗盘而已，没有那么多要考虑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......心里没事的人，手上可不会这么不安分。我该担心你在我的船上面抠出一个洞来吗，小家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有使那么大力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，一本正经的家伙才最让人觉得滑稽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换套衣服吧，你身上都是血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，忘记叫你屏住呼吸了，这间舱房已经封闭了数十年，灰尘很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我不该在你的船舱里随意乱碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我说得像个小气又记仇的女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想摸就上手摸摸吧，这些都是最上等的炼金器械，没那么脆弱。你肯定不觉得自己那只小手比风暴和炮火更有破坏力吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，以后这就是你的工作室了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一间正规的舰载炼金工坊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是以前船上炼金术师的衣服，试试吧。你和他身量差不多，应该合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左手边有间储藏室，去那里换吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里奇怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不奇怪，很合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，你喜欢吗？虽然是几十年前的款式，但却是专门订制的，用的都是上好的面料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可衣服摸起来像是崭新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来想作为成年礼物送给那孩子的，但他没福气，成年前一天跟国防军的炮弹一起掉进海里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亲自去捞，什么也没捞上来。好在那时候海嗣不多，但愿他是喂了普通的鳞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们打过国防军的舰队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大静谧之前，人人都还能出海的时候的事情了。这艘征服宣告号也是那时抢来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你对历史感兴趣，小家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是听过一些有关海洋的传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就该把罗盘修好，然后亲自到海上去见证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前的要求只是我帮你修复罗盘，现在又增加了出海这一项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海上，罗盘也需要炼金术师来操作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来，让我看看，领子再稍微竖起来些，把披肩搭好，真不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，剩下的我自己来就好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天你尽量避免剧烈活动，虽然伤势不致命，但船队里卫生条件太差，一旦恶化后果不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了......怎么感觉还差点儿什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还差一枚罗盘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"接过胡安娜递过来的罗盘，伊西多用拇指轻轻摩挲着它的表面。\n很轻，很冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能保证自己能成功，胡安娜女士，但我愿意尽全力尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽全力吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然承诺了，我一定会做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也会尽全力支持你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，首先，我需要一个助手，要求不高，勤快点，机灵点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有一件礼物，我要给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g10_community_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真如首领所说，我们确实别无他法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们与镇上的人世代仇怨，而他们把守着盐漠通往内陆的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，我们无路可退，只能面向大海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道就没有别的出路吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲁斯先生！哈维尔先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喘口气把话说清楚，到底怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回、回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有、有几个被抓的家伙......逃、逃回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像......还带着一个新人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"看，从外面带回来的壮小伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"能挑能扛，吃得不多，只要请我两个月咸鳞汁，他就能给你随便使唤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欣喜的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长得好像还不错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这么白，这么瘦，感觉盐鳞一尾巴就能把他扫飞......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你这样说，我可就不乐意了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我肌肉可是很结实的，穿衣显瘦而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"看一看啊！只要一个半月咸鳞汁，这个小伙子就归你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？像我这样的大帅哥应该值一年的咸鳞汁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴吧，没看到没人要你吗？还自己涨价了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年的咸鳞汁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"一个月！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"两周！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拍卖的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"呸！三天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境&拍卖的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天份的咸鳞汁，账记在我的名字下面，成交？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正好缺个保镖，你以后就跟在我身边好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想......就叫你小红毛吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然在盐漠底下藏了这样一个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，可别声张，会有人听到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个玩笑不好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你分辨不出来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......你带我来是要我帮忙杀掉这只海嗣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你为什么要带我来看它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，你来到盐漠是为了寻找一种由海盗创立的剑术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要找的就是它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修罗盘修累了，你可以找它学剑术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一只海嗣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一只吞噬了无数剑士的海嗣。如今，它触肢的每一次扭动都展现出那些剑士的技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许只是一种无意义的模仿行为，又或许它认为这样能帮助自己逃脱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到底是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解释起来有点难，当年想尽办法将它困在这里后，我贴出悬赏令，希望找到能杀死它的剑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多人前来尝试，但他们最终只是让自己和自己的剑，都成了它的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更迷惑了。你为什么要把它困在这里？为什么要找人杀它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又为什么要我学习它的剑术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本......船队的船长不是我，是它......他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的名字叫科鲁兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年淹没了这片土地的海水退去时，残存的海嗣都开始发了疯似的攻击城镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们拼死拼活，杀死了大部分海嗣......但这一只格外难缠。科鲁兹拿自己当诱饵，把它引入洞窟，他们一起被困在了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一次见面的时候，他将船长的职务交给我，嘱咐我一定要带着大家回到海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不告诉大家真相？船队里一直流传着有关海嗣的恐怖传言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些恐怖的传言，就让它们流传吧......要领导船队，我不仅需要他们敬爱我，还需要他们害怕我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那时就已经想好这些了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是科鲁兹告诉我的，他总觉得自己会死在我前头，所以什么都和我讲，希望我在他死后能继续他的事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早该帮他解脱的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的想，但真的很难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没法亲手去杀......哪怕我知道那是一只海嗣。我爱他，正如我深爱过去那些远航的时日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答应我，拼了命去学，往你的小脑袋瓜里能塞多少就塞多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，我还能......看到那些由他创立的剑术。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小叶？极境传来的消息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接播放吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂......我已经跟着逃跑的强盗回到了他们的老巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，没人发现我的身份，在这里我已经找到愿意罩着我的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在这里左右逢源，跟着她我很快就能找到棘刺的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，温蒂，等我的好消息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小红毛，帮我把箱子搬到这里来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，老板！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，力气还蛮大的，今天你可要使劲吆喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命，老板！你就看我的吧，货物清单我已经背得滚瓜烂熟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等我在这里混熟了找到棘刺，我还用听你这小丫头的使唤？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人来了，快喊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上好的假眼球！盐鳞骨雕刻，佩戴超绝舒适，多种颜色可供选购！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有店主珍藏陈年咸鳞汁！口感醇厚，令人陶醉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士们，先生们，走过路过请不要错过！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嚯......这家伙这么会，嗓门真够大的，一点也不像个当奴隶的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士们，先生们，走过！路过！不要错过——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......老板，我嗓子都要喊废了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人都盯着咱们这边，但过来的怎么一个也没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......生意冷清得过分，而且，怎么今天连找我理论的人都没来一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要来一颗吗，先生？万一以后用得上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神情古怪的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不买，帕斯卡拉小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，不买就不买，你那是什么眼神，看得人毛毛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神情古怪的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我劝你还是夹紧尾巴做事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，你不是说自己在这里很吃得开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了......要不是我当老板的为你疏通关系，你这个外来的家伙早就引起别人怀疑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这两个人不是向来不把我放在眼里吗？怎么今天停下来看我好几眼？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小红毛，你先收摊回去，我去打听些事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几个家伙带来的消息真的准确吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经派人去核实了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的相信吗？只要交出罗盘与偷罗盘的贼，大家就可以获得赦免，在镇子里定居？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还放任这城里来的红毛小子混进船队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经不知道该相信什么了，鲁斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是喜怒无常的大海，还是不可捉摸的好意？但无论如何，留着他我们终归能多一个选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果事情真的发展到那一步，那女孩好办，绑起来交出去就行，但罗盘在首领手里，你要怎么交出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我会去找她谈谈的，事关船队，她会听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谈谈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原来还信你能劝得动她，现在我只觉得你又会被她带跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想让我怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢，作为船队的话事人之一，你总该拿出些担当来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吃鳞屎的审判庭经棍，亏他们想得出这种主意，真歹毒啊......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g10_community_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板......你怎么一回来就唉声叹气的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说......呜......我听说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭，老板，你说，我帮你想法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小红毛，你对我真好，呜呜呜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（废话，我现在得靠你在这里混下去。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小红毛，我是为你愁啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，老板，这和我有什么关系哇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我孤身一人在外漂，难过点也就难过点，但现在有了你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，我任劳任怨给你干了这么多天活，你不会现在要把我开掉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我只是担心，要是我出了什么事，把你一个人孤零零地丢在这海盗窝里，怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（死丫头又拿这个要挟我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是太感动了，放心，我小红毛发誓，绝对不会让老板你出事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小红毛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我晚上在船队里......听到大家都在谈论，说是要把我交给审判庭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为我拿了个罗盘，这东西之前还是我们家的呢，审判庭就穷追不舍，躲进盐漠他们也不放过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看我现在落魄，当年我家可是有名的富商呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是家里的财产都被变卖了，其中的罗盘不知怎的就落到了审判庭手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真厉害啊，老板。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呵，我一个字都不会信。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那您有什么要我做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我听说船队里的炼金术师在招助手，那人可是首领当前最器重的人，不如，我把你送过去试试？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你人机灵，又勤快，肯定能获得他的赏识，到时候，你可不要忘记帮我说两句好话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么好的差事，老板你为什么不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嘛......我和那家伙有一点点......一丢丢......一捏捏的小过节。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿见到人家嘴巴甜一点！要有眼色知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，老板，我一定在那位炼金术师有需要时第一时间冲上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你也别太积极了，时机......时机也很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让他太舒服，稍等片刻，在他感到些许焦躁时再上去帮忙，他会更加离不开你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这话说的，让我觉得怪怪的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们两人的命运就都靠你了，小红毛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等我在炼金术师那里混熟了，谁管你这油嘴滑舌的丫头。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哭泣的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哭泣的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的太过分了！怎么可以这样说我！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是“硬汉比利”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"硬汉比利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，那小子不是号称自己去年从桅杆上掉下来都没有喊过一声痛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么从那间屋子里出来就哭得稀里哗啦的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们也是来应聘炼金术师助手的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对......对啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听我的，赶紧回去吧，小伙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位炼金术师他......经常发脾气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，比那还要恐怖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心啦，小红毛，别听他们在这里讲坏话，那位炼金术师人很好的，之前还救过我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人在工作时总会展露出另一副丑恶面孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这倒是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我进去不过三秒就被赶出来了，他嫌弃我呼吸的声音太响吵到他工作了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）老板，我记得你和这位炼金术师有点小过节，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我不去了，你这不是把我往火坑里面送吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）哼，都走到大门口了，你还想溜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不进去！你这丫头准没安好心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我进去！想跑，没门！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从我肩膀上下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！别揪我眉毛，我看不见路了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你往哪里走？你要撞上门了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......好痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不论你们出于什么原因在工坊外打闹，都打扰到了我的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我把你们从窗户丢出去，还是你们自己离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起啦，我只是想给你介绍一个助手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你指的是那些分不清烧杯和烧瓶的家伙吗？还是自己带回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙讲话攻击性好强哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，这家伙是新来的，不懂规矩，你别......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小红毛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，正是我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我说你们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没人理会帕斯卡拉。伊西多揽过“小红毛”的肩膀。\n“小红毛”也将自己的手臂回架在他的肩膀上，搭在一起的两只胳臂就像连接桥梁的坚固缆绳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们互相拍着对方的肩膀，力度之大，堪称殴打。\n“小红毛”的脸已经和他的红毛一样红了，表情也因为痛苦扭成一团。\n而伊西多......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这几天是没吃饱饭吗？怎么下手有气无力的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了，我为了找你可是掉了许多体重，你可得请我好好吃一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么找来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空再说我，先说说你？居然没有少只胳膊少条腿，你小子运气不赖嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这遗憾的语气是怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂......那个......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕斯卡拉没能插上话，对面两人聊起来没完没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕斯卡拉决定离开，临走时她顺手关好了门。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
